            "title": "Move With You",
            "heading_size": "h4",
            "heading_tag": "h3",
            "text": "<p>Your body does more in a shift than most bodies do in a week. Your clothes should follow, not fight. We design for movement—bending, reaching, stretching—without readjusting.</p>",
            "text_size": "text-inherit"
          }
